  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>X</mi></math> and <math><mi>Y</mi></math> be two events such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>X</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>|</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> Then",
